  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the oven to 300°F (150°C).",
    "In a large Dutch oven, heat the olive oil over medium-high heat.",
    "Add the garlic and cook for 1 minute, until fragrant.",
    "Add the smoked paprika and cook for 30 seconds, until fragrant.",
    "Add the short ribs and cook for 2 minutes, until browned on all sides.",
    "Add the datterini tomatoes, kosher salt, and black pepper. Stir to combine.",
    "Add the red wine and beef broth, and bring to a boil.",
    "Transfer the Dutch oven to the preheated oven and braise for 2 1/2 hours, until the short ribs are tender.",
    "Remove the Dutch oven from the oven and stir in the Argentinian chimichurri seasoning.",
    "Let the braise rest for 10 minutes, then serve with fresh parsley garnished on top."
  ],
